OL,3,ABA flight forced to turn back over
OL,4,Acracked window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Airways flight en route to
OL,7,FPortugal was forced to return to
OL,8,FGatwick Airport on Tuesday due to a
OL,9,Fminor technical issue, reported to be a
OL,10,Fcracked window.
OL,12,FFlight BA2660 was heading to Faro in
OL,13,Fthe Algarve but diverted over
OL,14,Fnorth-western France in order to return
OL,15,Fto London Gatwick.
OL,17,FAirNav Radar, a flight data provider,
OL,18,Fposted on X that "a passenger window is
OL,19,Fcracked. Flight deck going through
OL,20,Fchecks before deciding were to divert".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
